REPOSITORY
----------

  Name:        oreoOS ("Oreo Badge")
  What it is:  A handheld, panda-themed conference badge that runs a MicroPython
               operating system on ESP32-S3 hardware - the OreoOS firmware, the
               oreoWare drivers, the on-device apps, and the host-side
               flashing/OTA tooling.

